          "What color is the box?",
          "這個箱子什麼顏色？",
          "What color is the box? It's red."
        ],
        [
          "What color is the balloon?",
          "這個氣球什麼顏色？",
          "What color is the balloon? It's blue."
        ]
      ]
    },
